2026-04-07 23:47:52.466 | 522545 (522545) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": "{\"plan\": \"# Plan: Merge Left Sidebar into Right Sidebar\\n\\n## Goal\\nRemove the left sidebar entirely and merge all its panels into the right sidebar. The right sidebar becomes the single sidebar with panels ordered: **Left panels first, then Right panels**.\\n\\nFinal panel order in right sidebar:\\n1. `settings` \u2014 Metadata Manifest (Settings icon)\\n2. `templates` \u2014 Layout Blueprint (LayoutTemplate icon)\\n3. `navigator` \u2014 Architecture (Layers icon)\\n4. `section` \u2014 Section/Chapter Synthesis (FileText icon)\\n5. `global` \u2014 Intelligence Matrix (SlidersHorizontal icon)\\n6. `chat` \u2014 Project Consultant (MessageSquare icon)\\n7. `snapshots` \u2014 Temporal Snapshots (History icon)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Files to Change\\n\\n### 1. `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/hooks/builder/useSidebarPanels.tsx`\\n- Merge `leftPanels` items into the beginning of `rightPanels`\\n- Remove `leftPanels` entirely\\n- Return only `{ rightPanels }` (or keep `leftPanels` as empty array for compat)\\n\\n### 2. `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/hooks/report-mode/useReportGenerator.ts`\\n- Remove `leftPanels` from destructure and return value (or keep as `[]`)\\n\\n### 3. `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/BuilderWorkspace.tsx`\\n- Remove `leftPanels` from destructure\\n- Remove the `leftSidebar` prop from `<BuilderLayout>` (pass nothing / `undefined`)\\n\\n### 4. `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/layout/BuilderLayout.tsx`\\n- The `leftSidebar` prop is already optional \u2014 no change needed (it will simply not render when undefined)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Notes\\n- `BuilderSidebar` footer shows \\\"Registry Node 01\\\" for left and \\\"Registry Node 02\\\" for right \u2014 after merge, the right sidebar will display \\\"Registry Node 02\\\" which is fine\\n- No changes needed to `CollapsibleSidePanel`, `BuilderSidebar`, or `BuilderLayout` \u2014 the architecture already supports a single sidebar\\n- The right sidebar CSS variable `--sidebar-w: 400px` provides enough width to accommodate all 7 panel icons\\n\"}", "tool_call_id": "toolu_vrtx_01EKYVy6sBNj1QDgdGpD1dk7", "id": null, "provider_name": null, "provider_details": null, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
