\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n   7                                                                                     Context\n   8 \n   9 The Arkan builder workspace is composed of the following layout components located in src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/layout/:\n  10 \n  11  \u2022 BuilderWorkspace.tsx \u2014 Root orchestrator. Manages fullscreen, onboarding, zoom, and composes all layout pieces.\n  12  \u2022 BuilderLayout.tsx \u2014 Structural shell. Three-zone flex row: left sidebar \u2192 canvas \u2192 right sidebar. Uses Framer Motion for animated entry/exit.\n  13  \u2022 BuilderHeader.tsx \u2014 Top bar. Project name editing, save status, and actions.\n  14  \u2022 BuilderSidebar.tsx \u2014 Collapsible side panels (left/right). Wraps CollapsibleSidePanel, drives width transitions, has a \"Stable Manifest\" footer.\n  15  \u2022 BuilderCanvas.tsx \u2014 Central viewport. Zoom orchestration, scroll area, dot-grid atmosphere, crop marks, floating zoom HUD.\n  16  \u2022 SidebarContainer.tsx \u2014 Inner panel wrapper. Dot-grid, sticky technical header, scrollable content.\n  17  \u2022 SidebarSection.tsx \u2014 Collapsible grouping within a panel. Animated height, high-density labels.\n  18  \u2022 types.ts \u2014 Shared prop interfaces (SidebarPanelConfig, BuilderSidebarProps).\n  19 \n  20 \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2