2026-04-08 01:50:44.162 | 5617  (5617) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": {"plan": "# Refactoring Plan: AI Generation & File Manager Professionalization\n\n## 1. Jargon Removal (The \"Professional Voice\")\n- **Generation HUDs**: Replace \"Neural Processing\" \u2192 \"AI Processing\", \"Selection Matrix\" \u2192 \"Text Selection\", \"Selection Pipe STABLE\" \u2192 \"AI Pipeline\".\n- **File Manager**: Rename \"Intelligence Analyst\" \u2192 \"Source Analyst\", \"Registry Node\" \u2192 \"Panel\", and \"Spectral Analysis\" \u2192 \"Content Analysis\".\n- **Tooltips/ARIA**: Standardize labels to be descriptive and functional (e.g., \"Fix grammar\" instead of \"Grammar Logic\").\n\n## 2. Shared Foundations Integration\n- **Grid & Motion**: Apply `AtmosphericGrid` and constants from `motion.ts` to all HUDs and panels for visual parity with the layout.\n- **Processing States**: Standardize the pulse and sparkle animations using the new `PANEL_TRANSITION` and `FADE_TRANSITION`.\n\n## 3. Component Hardening & Accessibility\n- **`SelectionGenerationHUD.tsx`**: Add missing ARIA labels to icon buttons and fix hardcoded fallback text.\n- **`IntelligenceAnalyst.tsx`**: Decouple the complex JSON rendering logic; replace \"Neural Probing\" placeholders with clean loading states.\n- **`UploadManager.tsx`**: Professionalize the \"Context Inspector HUD\" and ensure it follows the new sidebar aesthetics.\n\n## 4. Documentation\n- Update JSDoc in `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/generation/` and `file-manager/` to remove military/sci-fi terminology.\n- Ensure all component descriptions reflect standard Clean Architecture / DDD principles.\n"}, "tool_call_id": "pyd_ai_ef5a799951ab45be8a0ce1d0598c5d50", "id": null, "provider_name": "google-vertex", "provider_details": {"thought_signature": ""}, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
