xt-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.25em]">Output Idle</p>\n 245                                     <p className="text-[9px] font-medium italic">Execute analysis to view cognitive decomposition.</p>\n 246                                 </div>\n 247                             </div>\n 248                         )}\n 249                     </ScrollArea>\n 250                 </div>\n 251             </div>\n 252 \n 253             <div className="p-5 rounded-[24px] border border-primary/10 bg-muted/5 text-center space-y-2 group/info hover:bg-muted/10 transition-all">\n 254                 <p className="text-[9px] text-primary/40 italic leading-relaxed font-medium uppercase tracking-widest group-hover:text-primary/60 transition-colors px-4">\n 255                     Neural Analyst uses structural inference to identify critical data patterns within the Source Matrix.\n 256                 </p>\n 257             </div>\n 258         </div>\n 259     );\n 260 }\n 261 \n````'}
